an class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, he prefers to watch action movies, but I'll ask him anyway. <br>", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "image": "engenn3le03ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How is John, by the way? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He's well. Very busy. I know he has a lot to do today. He likes to finish his work in one day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then go tomorrow.  Maybe he is free then. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe. I'll ask him. <br>", "id": 3, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn3le03ob10re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le03ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le03ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Movies", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "I Need to Watch This! ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately explain information interests, hobbies, and preferences in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Subject and Object Pronouns", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pronouns are used in place of nouns. You use pronouns to talk about something or someone without repeating the name. <br><br>You use <span class=\"italic\">subject pronouns</span> when the pronoun is  <span class = \"italic\">doing</span> the action or is the main topic (subject) of the sentence.<br><br>You use <span class=\"italic\">object pronouns</span> when the pronoun is <span class=\"italic\">receiving </span>the action.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I</span> like to watch reality TV shows.  <br>Do you want to watch with <span class=\\\"strong\\\">me</span>?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">You</span> need help.<br>Let me help <span class=\\\"strong\\\">you</span>. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"him\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">He</span> is the new teacher.<br>I know <span class=\\\"strong\\\">him</span>. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" she\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" her\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">She</span> is Peter's sister.<br> Peter gave<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> her</span> the keys. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" it\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">It</span> is a house with a red door. <br> Where is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">it</span>?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"we\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" us\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">We</span> are lost.<br>Can you help <span class=\\\"strong\\\">us</span>?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"they\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" them\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">They</span> are Tom's parents.<br> I know <span class=\\\"strong\\\">them</span>. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Verbs with Infinitives ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Some verbs take infinitives (to + verb) after them.<br><br>You use infinitives to say what you want or prefer.<br><br>You use this form: <br>prefer to + verb <br>want to + verb", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I prefer to finish my work and then think about fun.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I want to watch this movie. I hope Peter can go with me.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I thought I'd die", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I was so surprised and scared!", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was so cold, I thought I'd die.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Use these words to talk about an exciting movie.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sounds exciting", "type": "name"}, {"content": " say this to express enthusiasm about something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The movie sounds exciting. I want to see it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "by the way", "type": "name"}, {"content": "say this to give additional information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: By the way, I met Karen today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a lot to do", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very busy; to have many things to do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am busy this week. I have a lot to do!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "free ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not busy; available", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter is free for the movie tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "busy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not free; have a lot of things to do", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am very busy this week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le03ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": " Choose a genre (type) of movie you both like. Examples: romance, thriller, action", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about some movies in that genre.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use <span class=\"italic\">want to + verb</span> and <span class=\"italic\">prefer to + verb</span> to write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use subject and object pronouns in the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about movies with people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue about  movies that I like or prefer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}